WHAT SHIPPED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A production-polished, Apple-idiomatic SwiftUI parity of the web Helix log/trace
summarization card. The web source is
`withAiFeature('log-trace-summarization', InnerSection)` composing the shared
`AIFeatureCard` + `AiOutputPanel` over `useAiStream('/ai/system/logs/summarize')`
with the in-scope log/trace window in the POST body. Reproduced natively as 10
files following the established per-surface pattern (precedent: 0009
AICabinTemperatureImpactNarrative, 0017 AIDriveCoaching, 0022
AIIncidentTimelineSummarizer):

  AILogTraceSummarization.Adapter.swift      - pure-Foundation core: the window seam
       (LogTraceWindow: Number.isFinite coercion + haveWindow/windowSeconds/
       windowAcceptable + the 24h cap), the request (zeroed non-acceptable body +
       conditional vehicle_id, snake_case, /ai/system/logs/summarize), SSE frame
       parse, the delta-accumulating stream reducer, output + action derivations.
  AILogTraceSummarization.Model.swift        - P1/S10 i18n facade, P1/S11 telemetry
       seam, the coalesced input snapshot, the P1/S8 state-holder protocol, the
       @Observable model (deferred view.opened + one-shot stale auto-refresh), and
       the in-memory source for previews/tests.
  AILogTraceSummarization.Projection.swift   - pure projection: gate/loading/error/
       ready + canStart=windowAcceptable + every localized AiOutputPanel branch.
  AILogTraceSummarization.Views.swift        - Helix badge, universal Ask-Helix
       button (label flips to "Helix is thinking…"), thinking indicator, output
       panel, ready body (Reduce-Motion aware).
  AILogTraceSummarization.Chrome.swift       - P4 leaf chrome: freshness chip,
       refresh, stale/offline banner, loading skeleton, retryable gate-error.
  AILogTraceSummarization.swift              - the surface view: withAiFeature gate
       (EmptyView when off) + card chrome + phase switch.
  AILogTraceSummarization.Previews.swift     - 10 states (idle/thinking/prose/
       stream-error/no-window/loading/gate-error/stale/offline/gated).
  AILogTraceSummarization.strings            - the i18n catalog (4 web parity keys +
       the Helix scaffold literals + the native P4 chrome copy).
  AILogTraceSummarization.Tests.swift        - projection/model/telemetry/stale/a11y.
  AILogTraceSummarization.AdapterTests.swift - window/request/SSE/reducer/output/action.

States reproduced (every non-gated one renders — never a blank box): gated (web
withAiFeature -> null), loading, error (retryable gate-error) + inline stream
error, ready (empty / thinking / prose / failed), plus the orthogonal live /
stale / offline freshness axis with a one-shot auto-refresh on the stale edge.
i18n: every string resolves through the P1/S10 facade (table
"AILogTraceSummarization"); no English literals in Swift. Accessibility: VoiceOver
labels on every interactive element, Dynamic Type, Reduce-Motion respect.
Telemetry: deferred `view.opened` with surface slug "AILogTraceSummarization".
No HTTP in the view — data binds through the P1/S8 state-holder seam.

Allowed files only. project.yml + .swiftlint.yml already wire
TeslaSync/shared-surfaces into both app targets + both XCTest bundles (no edit
needed). Generated TeslaSync.xcodeproj is git-ignored.

